      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "\ud83d\udeab  NO FABRICATION\n\nUpstream agents build a citation registry from real tool\noutput. The LLM only references by index \u2014 invented IDs\nstripped before render. Sentiment URL provenance via\nGrok's actual citations[] array.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udeab  NO FABRICATION\n\nUpstream agents build a citation registry from real tool\noutput. The LLM only references by index \u2014 invented IDs\nstripped before render. Sentiment URL provenance via\nGrok's actual citations[] array.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    },
