      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "\ud83d\udcf0  SOURCE DENYLIST\n\nWikipedia, Reddit, Substack, Medium, Forbes contributor,\nYahoo aggregator \u2014 blocked at agent boundary. Curated\nallowlist surfaces trader-grade outlets only; off-list\nsurvivors flagged 'unverified'.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udcf0  SOURCE DENYLIST\n\nWikipedia, Reddit, Substack, Medium, Forbes contributor,\nYahoo aggregator \u2014 blocked at agent boundary. Curated\nallowlist surfaces trader-grade outlets only; off-list\nsurvivors flagged 'unverified'.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
