      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "\u267b\ufe0f  SELF-HEALING NEWS\n\nExa retries 3\u00d7 \u00d7 3 query variants \u00d7 429 Retry-After.\nFalls through to Polymarket comments \u2192 provider web.\n6 h LRU cache hides transient failures behind prior\nsuccess. Honest diagnostic only when truly stuck.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u267b\ufe0f  SELF-HEALING NEWS\n\nExa retries 3\u00d7 \u00d7 3 query variants \u00d7 429 Retry-After.\nFalls through to Polymarket comments \u2192 provider web.\n6 h LRU cache hides transient failures behind prior\nsuccess. Honest diagnostic only when truly stuck.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    },
