      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "\u2705  RESOLVED MARKETS\n\nSentiment + thesis SKIPPED \u2014 both produce their worst\nhallucinations when there's no real-time data to ground\nin. News searches the leadup window (30 d before\nresolution), not 'right now'.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
